DTEND;TZID=America/Chicago:20261121T210000
DTSTAMP:20260907T203358Z
UID:hipointe-performance-604042@hipointe-calendar
SEQUENCE:0
DESCRIPTION:Runtime: 90 minutes\nFormat: Digital Projection Live Comedy wi
 th VHS tapes! Joe Pickett (The Onion) and Nick Prueher (Late Show With Dav
 id Letterman) have over 15\,000 VHS tapes in their cluttered office in Bro
 oklyn and will take viewers on a guided tour of their latest/greatest find
 s in this brand new Volume 11 show for 2026. Highlights include a psychoti
 c dollar store salesman\, a video catalog of frightening porcelain dolls\,
  two wonderfully homemade Bigfoot videos and a new age “miracle” treat
 ment from the 80s called “Psychic Surgery.” (90 mins – contains nudi
 ty\, language\, clowns) “I think I speak for fans everywhere when I expr
 ess gratitude for their continued hunt for hilariously bad videos. I hope 
 the search never ends.” -Steven Hyden\, Uproxx Special Event Trailer Cin
 ema St. Louis Policies Parking & Directions Accessibility Contact Copyrigh
 t © 2026\nDirector: Joe Pickett\, Nick Prueher\nLanguage: English\n\nhttp
 s://hipointetheatre.org/movies/the-found-footage-fest-porcelain-vhs-treasu
 res/
LOCATION:Hi-Pointe Theatre\n1005 McCausland Ave\nSt. Louis\, MO 63117
STATUS:CONFIRMED
URL:https://hipointetheatre.org/movies/the-found-footage-fest-porcelain-vh
 s-treasures/
